OL,3,GNEWSAMore schools shut for strikes over
OL,4,ACatholic academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore schools across the North West have
OL,7,Fbeen affected by strike action over
OL,8,Fplans to take them into academy trusts.
OL,10,FTwo Catholic schools, in Preston and in
OL,11,FFleetwood, were set to be closed on
OL,12,FMonday and Tuesday, following on from
OL,13,Fsimilar strike action in Merseyside
OL,14,Fearlier this month.
OL,16,FThe National Education Union (NEU) has
OL,17,Fclaimed plans for every Catholic school
OL,18,Fin the Diocese Of Lancaster to become
OL,19,Fan academy will drain vital funds away
OL,20,Ffrom the classroom and see teacher
OL,21,Fnumbers cut.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
